			dependencies: ["49A55E2BB4D1745C"]
			description: ["The &lCleanroom&r is a large machine that allows you to run new recipes. If a machine needs the cleanroom to do a recipe, then you need to place it inside of the cleanroom. You can make cleanrooms of variable size."]
