			dependencies: ["0DBFA407F32A1BBD"]
			description: [
				"From now on a lot of ingots made in the EBF will come out hot, and some can't be cooled with just a chemical bath. To make them usable you will need a &bVacuum Freezer&r."
				"Even for the ingots that can be cooled with the bath, the vacuum freezer is still prefered as it is a lot faster."
				""
